{
  "name": "dsh-essential-tools",
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "description": "DSH 永久插件：LVAL 工程工具（编译/运行/代码查看/程序版本快照回退）+ 对话树（会话内分支/编辑/重新生成）+ 消息小版本 + DET 管理器。Permanent DeepSeek Harness plugin: project run & code viewer, program snapshots, VTD conversation tree (in-session edit/retry/branches), message micro-versions and a feature manager.",
